	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Eterna salute maximas ago gratias tuę hu<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>manitati, pręstantissime vir, quę non dedignata <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>est scribere pauperculo Christi servo, loco meorum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>charissimorum fratrum domini <persName>Iohannis Schne<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>wolffii</persName> ac socii eius <persName>Petri</persName>, qui iam, ut scribis, du<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>dum extremum diem clauserunt, qui mei angeli <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fuerunt me educentes de tenebris et umbra <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>mortis.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ipsorum persuasione adeptus sum cognicio<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nem Christi et eius evangelii, alias periissem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>in secta illa <persName>Carthusiana</persName> tam corpore quam anima.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Ideo me continere haud potui, cum adesset civis v<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ester <placeName ref="l587">Tiguriensis</placeName> ac promisit se omnino literas prę<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sentaturum, quod et fideliter fecit, quin aliquid literarum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>exerarem, quibus vitam seu obitum meorum fratrum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>possem explorare.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Iam nihil aliud restat, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ut hortaris tuis literis, nisi ut me quoque disponam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>hoc iter, quod ipsi fęlicissimo fine peregerunt, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>propediem peragere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Deus optimus maximus faxit prosperum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>finem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Dominum <persName ref="p1000">Ehingerum</persName> commendatum habeto; <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nam multa mihi scripsit de beneficiis in ipsum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>per tuam humanitatem ceterosque ecclesiarum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>vestrarum ministros collatis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis nomine <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>meo dominum <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>; nam eius commentariis <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Bibliorum utor plurimum quemadmodum et tuis in Matheum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>et epistolas Pauli meis in sermonibus, necne et <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>civis ille, qui ad te fideli manu pertulit literas, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>mei causa salutetur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Valeat t[ua] h[umanitas] quam fęlicissime <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>in <persName>Nestoreos</persName> usque annos.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Datum in <placeName ref="l191">Guntzenhausen</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>19. novembris anno 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tę humanitati de<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ditissimus <persName ref="p3039">Sebastianus St<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>illerus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Excellentissimo prestan<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>tissimoque viro domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguriensis</placeName> pastori vigilan<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>tissimo, suo fratri unice <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>dilecto.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
